    "text": "Height$20k$30k$40kSalarygenderFigure 1: Toy example: Minoria mining using high-skew projections. Instead, in this paper, we propose a novel approach that involves identifying high-skew projections of data along a specific direction in the feature space. Before outlining our technical contributions, we acknowledge that our approach is only one of the possible solu- tions for Minoria mining. There may be other complementary and equally effective techniques that address this problem. We hope that this paper will pave the way for future research to explore alternative approaches.",
